---
interface Props {kind:'flow'|'retry'|'tests'}
const {kind}=Astro.props;
const names={flow:['The model is one component of the application','Figure 1. Python checks inputs, assembles a request, calls an adapter, validates the response, and returns a draft for evidence review. Only the live adapter contacts a model service.'],retry:['A retry needs a reason and a stopping point','Figure 2. The teaching app allows one or two total attempts. It retries only selected temporary provider failures. Invalid content, refusals, and permanent configuration failures stop.'],tests:['Different tests answer different questions','Figure 3. Local tests establish application behavior. A live integration test checks the provider connection. Task evaluations assess the usefulness and grounding of real model outputs. Passing one layer does not establish the others.']};
const id='application-'+kind;
---
<figure class="diagram"><div class="figure-title"><span class="figure-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>{names[kind][0]}</div><div class="diagram-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label={names[kind][0]}><svg viewBox={kind==='flow'?'0 0 760 255':'0 0 760 232'} role="img" aria-labelledby={id+'-title '+id+'-desc'}><title id={id+'-title'}>{names[kind][0]}</title><desc id={id+'-desc'}>{names[kind][1]}</desc><defs><marker id={id+'-arrow'} markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L7 3.5 L0 7 Z" fill="var(--accent)"/></marker></defs>
{kind==='flow'&&<>
  {[['Check input','IDs, text, size'],['Build request','instructions + schema'],['Provider adapter','fixture OR live API']].map(([label,detail],i)=><g><rect x={10+i*255} y="16" width="225" height="78" rx="7" class={i===2?'node node-accent':'node'}/><text x={122+i*255} y="47" text-anchor="middle" class="node-title">{label}</text><text x={122+i*255} y="73" text-anchor="middle" class="node-detail">{detail}</text></g>)}
  {[0,1].map(i=><line x1={238+i*255} x2={260+i*255} y1="55" y2="55" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end={'url(#'+id+'-arrow)'}/>)}
  <path d="M632 94 V135 H379 V158" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end={'url(#'+id+'-arrow)'}/>
  <rect x="265" y="165" width="225" height="76" rx="7" class="node"/><text x="377" y="197" text-anchor="middle" class="node-title">Inspect and validate</text><text x="377" y="222" text-anchor="middle" class="node-detail">status → JSON → contract</text>
  <line x1="495" x2="515" y1="203" y2="203" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end={'url(#'+id+'-arrow)'}/>
  <rect x="520" y="165" width="225" height="76" rx="7" class="node node-accent"/><text x="632" y="197" text-anchor="middle" class="node-title">Draft for review</text><text x="632" y="222" text-anchor="middle" class="node-detail">compare claims with sources</text>
  <text x="120" y="184" text-anchor="middle" class="node-title">Failures return</text><text x="120" y="210" text-anchor="middle" class="node-detail">a clear status, no accepted suggestion</text>
</>}
{kind==='retry'&&<>
  <rect x="10" y="74" width="165" height="78" rx="7" class="node"/><text x="92" y="106" text-anchor="middle" class="node-title">Provider error</text><text x="92" y="132" text-anchor="middle" class="node-detail">classify first</text>
  <path d="M175 113 H220 V50 H270 M220 113 V181 H270" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2"/>
  <rect x="270" y="14" width="256" height="77" rx="7" class="node node-accent"/><text x="398" y="44" text-anchor="middle" class="node-title">Temporary + budget left</text><text x="398" y="71" text-anchor="middle" class="node-detail">bounded wait is acceptable</text>
  <rect x="270" y="143" width="256" height="77" rx="7" class="node"/><text x="398" y="173" text-anchor="middle" class="node-title">Permanent or exhausted</text><text x="398" y="201" text-anchor="middle" class="node-detail">configuration, quota, or no attempt left</text>
  {[50,182].map(y=><line x1="531" x2="580" y1={y} y2={y} stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end={'url(#'+id+'-arrow)'}/>)}
  <rect x="589" y="14" width="155" height="77" rx="7" class="node"/><text x="666" y="45" text-anchor="middle" class="node-title">Wait → retry</text><text x="666" y="71" text-anchor="middle" class="node-detail">at most once here</text>
  <rect x="589" y="143" width="155" height="77" rx="7" class="node"/><text x="666" y="174" text-anchor="middle" class="node-title">Stop</text><text x="666" y="200" text-anchor="middle" class="node-detail">return service_error</text>
</>}
{kind==='tests'&&<>
  {[['Local tests','prepared responses','Does our code handle each case?'],['Live integration','real service, small input','Can the request complete?'],['Task evaluation','varied cases, reviewed answers','Are outputs grounded and useful?']].map(([title,detail,question],i)=><g><rect x={10+255*i} y="24" width="225" height="125" rx="7" class={i===2?'node node-accent':'node'}/><text x={122+255*i} y="58" text-anchor="middle" class="node-title">{title}</text><text x={122+255*i} y="88" text-anchor="middle" class="node-detail">{detail}</text><text x={122+255*i} y="124" text-anchor="middle" class="node-detail">{question}</text></g>)}
  <text x="380" y="191" text-anchor="middle" class="node-title">A working connection does not establish answer quality.</text><text x="380" y="219" text-anchor="middle" class="node-detail">This chapter ships local checks; live quality depends on the chosen model and task.</text>
</>}
</svg></div><figcaption>{names[kind][1]}</figcaption></figure>
